1
00:00:01,150 --> 00:00:02,840
This support bot has been rewritten

2
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:03,830
five times,

3
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:05,530
mostly by an AI coach.

4
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:06,920
Every new version had to beat

5
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:08,160
the champion in a live

6
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:09,660
Flagsmith experiment,

7
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:11,680
and a person approves every change.

8
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:14,020
Today,

9
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:15,560
teams change the prompts behind their

10
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:17,400
AI features on gut feel.

11
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:18,500
Tweak the prompt,

12
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,300
read a few answers, deploy,

13
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:21,340
and hope.

14
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:24,000
Nobody measures what customers actually experience.

15
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:27,610
Darwin puts the agent's whole brain,

16
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:28,330
its prompt,

17
00:00:28,350 --> 00:00:29,680
model and effort,

18
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:32,250
into one Flagsmith multivariate flag.

19
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:33,760
The champion is the control,

20
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:36,510
and every challenger is a variant.

21
00:00:36,530 --> 00:00:37,970
So changing the agent is a

22
00:00:37,990 --> 00:00:38,690
flag change,

23
00:00:38,710 --> 00:00:40,200
with no redeploy.

24
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:42,840
Our first version handed a quarter

25
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:44,470
of its chats to humans.

26
00:00:44,490 --> 00:00:44,950
Here,

27
00:00:44,970 --> 00:00:46,520
it fixes a late order,

28
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:48,630
then offers a specialist anyway.

29
00:00:48,650 --> 00:00:49,820
The customer says yes,

30
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:51,100
and a human gets a ticket

31
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:52,380
that was already solved.

32
00:00:53,850 --> 00:00:54,930
Darwin's Coach,

33
00:00:54,950 --> 00:00:56,360
built on Claude Opus,

34
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:58,320
read 28 failed chats.

35
00:00:58,340 --> 00:00:59,540
It found the patterns,

36
00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:01,190
with counts and real quotes,

37
00:01:01,210 --> 00:01:02,670
and wrote a challenger with a

38
00:01:02,690 --> 00:01:04,770
hypothesis that Flagsmith can test.

39
00:01:06,140 --> 00:01:07,420
Nothing goes live until a

40
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:08,470
person approves.

41
00:01:08,490 --> 00:01:10,140
Every card shows the evidence,

42
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:11,250
the prompt diff,

43
00:01:11,270 --> 00:01:13,310
and the exact Flagsmith CLI commands

44
00:01:13,330 --> 00:01:14,190
it will run,

45
00:01:14,210 --> 00:01:15,600
in the approver's name.

46
00:01:17,950 --> 00:01:20,520
Flagsmith splits the traffic 50/50,

47
00:01:20,540 --> 00:01:23,060
across 160 simulated customers,

48
00:01:23,080 --> 00:01:24,610
and its Bayesian engine scores

49
00:01:24,630 --> 00:01:25,800
both versions.

50
00:01:25,820 --> 00:01:28,370
The challenger resolved 91% of chats,

51
00:01:28,390 --> 00:01:29,530
against 69%,

52
00:01:29,550 --> 00:01:33,300
with a 99.8% chance to win.

53
00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:33,970
One more approval,

54
00:01:33,990 --> 00:01:35,320
and Flagsmith rolls it out

55
00:01:35,340 --> 00:01:36,570
to everyone.

56
00:01:36,590 --> 00:01:37,340
No deploy.

57
00:01:38,780 --> 00:01:40,410
Then the Coach cut cost

58
00:01:40,430 --> 00:01:41,300
by 8%.

59
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:43,200
A teammate's two-line prompt cut

60
00:01:43,220 --> 00:01:44,260
another 27%,

61
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,210
but it had dropped the

62
00:01:45,230 --> 00:01:46,600
escalation rules.

63
00:01:46,620 --> 00:01:48,000
So the Coach put back only

64
00:01:48,020 --> 00:01:49,120
what mattered:

65
00:01:49,140 --> 00:01:50,520
100% resolved.

66
00:01:51,870 --> 00:01:52,640
In a live run,

67
00:01:52,660 --> 00:01:54,830
a teammate tried skipping policy lookups

68
00:01:54,850 --> 00:01:55,810
to save money,

69
00:01:55,830 --> 00:01:57,630
and Anugrah approved the test.

70
00:01:57,650 --> 00:01:58,270
Flagsmith,

71
00:01:58,290 --> 00:01:59,840
scoring cost alone,

72
00:01:59,860 --> 00:02:01,420
gave it a 94% chance

73
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:02,550
to win.

74
00:02:02,570 --> 00:02:04,650
But resolution collapsed,

75
00:02:04,670 --> 00:02:06,970
from 99% to 45%.

76
00:02:06,990 --> 00:02:09,310
Darwin's guardrail recommended a kill,

77
00:02:09,330 --> 00:02:10,520
Anugrah approved it,

78
00:02:10,540 --> 00:02:11,740
and every customer stayed on

79
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:12,660
the champion.

80
00:02:14,390 --> 00:02:15,900
Six generations,

81
00:02:15,920 --> 00:02:17,740
five Flagsmith experiments,

82
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:19,010
and about a dollar of

83
00:02:19,030 --> 00:02:19,930
Claude spend.

84
00:02:19,950 --> 00:02:20,680
Darwin.

85
00:02:20,700 --> 00:02:22,390
Your AI agent evolves.

86
00:02:22,410 --> 00:02:24,480
Flagsmith decides who survives.

87
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:25,920
You approve every change.

